---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="Business Rivalries continues with Gunrunning bonuses! Claim a free Grapeseed Bunker, earn 2X on Bunker Research and Ammu-Nation Contracts, and get the new Pegassi Horus."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">September 17, 2026 — September 23, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    A new GTA Online event starts on September 17 (available through September 23). Stock up and earn bonuses as a Gunrunner during the third week of the <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">Business Rivalries Event</span>. Claim a <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">free Grapeseed Bunker</span>, get Double Rewards on Bunker Research Missions and Ammu-Nation Contracts, and grab the new Pegassi Horus, which is now available for all players.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete three Bunker Research Missions to get GTA$1,000,000 and the Camo Ammu-Nation Sweatsuit</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Month-Long Challenge:</strong> Complete at least one Weekly Challenge over the next two weeks to claim a free Penaud La Coureuse and complimentary HSW upgrade when you play GTA Online between September 24-30</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Log In Unlock:</strong> Receive the Dolla Dolla livery for the Mammoth Avenger, Ocelot Ardent, Oppressor and Oppressor Mk II</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Business Battles:</strong> Deliver Business Battle crates to receive guaranteed clothing rewards: Six Figure Tee, Ride or Die Tee, Red and White Ammu-Nation Cap, or Bourgeoix Tee</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Property:</strong> Claim the Grapeseed Bunker for free</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Mission Series</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Featured Series (Stockpile & Trap Door), Ammu-Nation Contracts (Bunker Duneloader deliveries), and Safeguard Deliveries (Bobcat Security & Gruppe Sechs depots)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$, RP & RESEARCH PROGRESS:</strong> Bunker Research Missions (via Agent 14)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FREE (100% OFF):</strong> Grapeseed Bunker</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>70% OFF:</strong> Pfister Astron Custom (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Albany Hermes, Bravado Half-track, Buckingham Shamal, Grotti Bestia GTS, HVY Nightshark, Imponte Nightshade, Karin Everon, Lampadati Viseris, Ocelot XA-21, Pegassi Torero, Principe Lectro, Schyster Deviant, Shitzu Hakuchou Drag, Übermacht Niobe, Vom Feuer Anti-Aircraft Trailer, and Western Company Rogue</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF):</strong> Stun Gun</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF GTA+):</strong> Tactical SMG</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Compact EMP Launcher, Heavy Sniper, Pump Shotgun, Pipe Wrench, Tear Gas, Sticky Bombs & Molotovs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Vapid Dominator ASP</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Dinka LSCM Jester RR (Win in the LS Car Meet Series for four days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Bravado Half-track, HVY Nightshark, Imponte Nightshade, Ocelot XA-21 & Pegassi Torero</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Pegassi Horus & Progen Luiva</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Grotti Bestia GTS, Lampadati Viseris & Schyster Deviant</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Bravado Banshee GTS</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Congestion Charge</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Cypress Flats (Standard) & Sandy Shores to La Puerta (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Mi O Melee, To Beat About the Bush & Hare Oneself Think</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Brute Force File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The McTony Robbery - Declasse Mamba</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Podium Robbery - Dinka Sugoi</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Karin Previon</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MONTHLY EVENT RECAP SECTION -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); padding: 40px; margin-top: 4rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); text-align: left;">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4); margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">GTA Online: Business Rivalries Event Breakdown</h2>
            
            <p style="color: var(--white-med); font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                Four weeks (Sept 3-30) of business bonuses, free properties every week, up to GTA$4M in Weekly Challenges and a free Penaud La Coureuse. Full schedule below:
            </p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Month-Long Weekly Challenges (GTA$1,000,000 + Tracksuit)</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Event Bonus:</strong> Complete any single Weekly Challenge between September 3-23, then log in between September 24-30 to claim a free Penaud La Coureuse (Sports) at Legendary Motorsport, plus a free HSW upgrade (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced).</p>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Sept 3-9:</strong> Sell GTA$1,000,000 worth of Special Cargo to receive GTA$1,000,000 + the Yeti x LS Customs Tracksuit.</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 10-16:</strong> Earn GTA$1,000,000 selling all kinds of product to get GTA$1,000,000 + the Junk Tracksuit.</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 17-23:</strong> Complete three Bunker Research Missions to get GTA$1,000,000 + the Camo Ammu-Nation Sweatsuit.</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 24-30:</strong> Sell GTA$1,000,000 across all businesses to get GTA$1,000,000 + the Retro Fruit Tracksuit.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Free Properties by Week</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Sept 3-9:</strong> Arcadius Business Center Office</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 10-16:</strong> Grapeseed Clubhouse</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 17-23:</strong> Grapeseed Bunker</li>
                <li><strong>Sept 24-30:</strong> Elysian Island Nightclub</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Bonuses & Discounts Breakdown</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>September 3-9 (Executives):</strong> 4X GTA$ & RP on Special Vehicle Work. 3X GTA$ & RP on Community Mission Series. 2X GTA$ & RP on Export Mixed Goods & Madrazo Hits. 2X Speed on Special Cargo Staff Sourcing. 70% Off Coil Cyclone II (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced).</li>
                <li><strong>September 10-16 (Bikers):</strong> 2X GTA$ & RP on Clubhouse Contracts, MC Work & MC Challenges. 2X GTA$ on Street Dealer Sales & Bike Service Missions (6X for GTA+ Members). 70% Off Karin S95 (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced). Simeon's Premium Deluxe Motorsport showroom features discounted motorcycles.</li>
                <li><strong>September 17-23 (Gunrunning):</strong> Login Reward: Dolla Dolla livery (for Mammoth Avenger, Ocelot Ardent, Oppressor & Oppressor Mk II). 2X GTA$, RP & Research Speed on Bunker Research Missions (requested via Agent 14). 2X GTA$ & RP on Ammu-Nation Contracts (Bunker Duneloader deliveries) & Safeguard Deliveries (Bobcat Security & Gruppe Sechs depots). 70% Off Pfister Astron Custom (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced).</li>
                <li><strong>September 24-30 (Nightclubs):</strong> 2X Popularity on Nightclub Management Missions. 2X GTA$ & RP on Nightclub Goods Missions (via Yohan) & QuickiePharm Deliveries. 70% Off Imponte Arbiter GT (PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC Enhanced).</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>